data: {"id": "1b961baab2464685-thinking-parallel_evidence-529", "run_id": "1b961baab2464685", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我需要先执行 kubectl_describe 来确认 Pod 的当前状态和事件，然后根据 Metrics 结果决定后续步骤。Metrics 已经显示：\n- Pod 处于 Pending 阶段 (phase=1)\n- 容器等待原因为 ErrImagePull (waiting_reason=1)\n- 重启次数为 0 (restarts=0)\n\n这表明 Pod 从未成功启动容器，处于 ImagePull 失败状态。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788410349906, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

