data: {"id": "1b961baab2464685-thinking-parallel_evidence-2084", "run_id": "1b961baab2464685", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**Pod 状态确认**：\n- `workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 当前状态为 **Pending**，容器状态为 **Waiting (ImagePullBackOff)**\n- 根本原因：镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 无法解析 DNS — `lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n- 容器尚未启动，因此 kubectl logs 返回 `BadRequest: container is waiting to start`\n\n**Observability 工具失败原因**：\n`query_pod_logs` 和 `query_pod_tracing` 失败不是因为目标 Pod 没有数据，而是因为底层 observability 基础设施（Elasticsearch、ClickHouse）所在的 `monitor` 命名空间中，MCP serviceaccount 没有 `pods/exec` 权限来创建临时 Pod 执行查询。这是基", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788410377776, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

