data: {"id": "1b961baab2464685-final", "run_id": "1b961baab2464685", "seq": 2089, "ts_ms": 1788410393906, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `Error: ImagePullBackOff` (持续约 7m25s, 触发频率 x6) | 确认 Pod 处于最终重试等待状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 证明网络层 DNS 解析完全失败，无法联系仓库 |\n| 3 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, labels: `reason=ErrImagePull` | 独立观测佐证等待原因确认为拉取错误 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `pod.status` | `Pending` | 确认容器尚未调度至运行时启动，卡在镜像拉取前 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 确认 Pod 存活时间为 0，从未成功启动过 |\n\n证据互相印证，一致指向镜像拉取环节的失败：事件与指标确认等待原因为拉取失败，事件中的 `no such host` 错误排除了网络中断或仓库宕机的可能。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid → Kubelet DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → 镜像拉取失败触发 ErrImagePull → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 的镜像引用使用了保留域名 `registry.invalid`。Kubelet 在执行拉取操作时，DNS 解析彻底失败，无法发现主机名，导致镜像拉取永久失败并触发 `ImagePullBackOff` 机制。\n\n关键支撑证据为 Kubelet 事件 (fact-15c29f181cb7, fact-6ce864eaf0e6) 直接报告了 `no such host` 错误，以及 Prometheus 指标 (fact-60d429aedaed) 确认 `ErrImagePull` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 72.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4: 72.3s (Evidence 64.5s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 97.775, "metrics": {"run_id": "1b961baab2464685", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 97.78155374526978, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 97781.55374526978, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 92064.07427787781, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 11848.84524345398, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5259.549856185913}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17255.45835494995, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 72334.67221260071, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"n